{"4730120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runic Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4730120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runic Dungeon is a challenging fantasy rogue-lite bullet-hell dungeon crawler with RPG elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> your character and <strong>choose your weapons</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With five character classes and <strong>over 20 weapons</strong>, every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up</strong> and assemble <strong>arcane runes</strong> to <strong>craft</strong> unique, ultimate builds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>100 unique arcane runes</strong> to craft your gear with, every run offers a new way to empower your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up</strong> outside of the game and <strong>unlock new arcane runes</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, you <strong>progress a little further</strong> and allocate points to <strong>powerful runes</strong> that can be used in your next attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight against</strong> a <strong>large bestiary</strong> of enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>dozens of unique enemy classes</strong>! Adventure through <strong>hundreds of rooms</strong> across various <strong>themed dungeons</strong>, each featuring <strong>distinct boss encounters</strong> to defeat! Every run guarantees maximum <strong>gameplay variety and replayability</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runic Dungeon is a challenging fantasy rogue-lite bullet-hell dungeon crawler with RPG elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> your charac